## Root Cause Analysis

The vulnerability occurs in the address copying section of the `ping_recvmsg` function. Looking at the vulnerable code:

```c
/* Copy the address and add cmsg data. */
if (family == AF_INET) {
    struct sockaddr_in *sin = (struct sockaddr_in *)msg->msg_name;

    sin->sin_family = AF_INET;
    sin->sin_port = 0 /* skb->h.uh->source */;
